abstract: >-
  Housing units in 2-, 3- and 4-unit buildings, their share of all housing units and
  their owner-occupancy, for 83 US metropolitan areas and their principal cities, from
  the Census Bureau American Community Survey 5-year estimates 2020-2024
  (tables B25024 and B25032).
